  "notes": "支付确认清晰，更新更可靠。\n\n本次维护更新延续近期的连接、订阅和账号改进，并完善发布验证。\n\n- 支付通道调整余额抵扣与待付金额后，订单和钱包会及时刷新；请重新确认金额后继续付款，旧支付链接不会复用。\n- Windows TUN 服务安装失败时显示具体步骤、错误码和处理建议。\n- 同一订阅同时刷新不再互相覆盖，保留最新的名称、链接和更新间隔。\n- 改密码、两步验证等一次性操作避免重复提交；退出登录时清除本地消息缓存。\n",
  "notesEn": "Clear payment confirmation and reliable updates.\n\nThis maintenance release carries forward recent connection, subscription, and account improvements and strengthens release validation.\n\n- Orders and wallet balances refresh when a payment channel adjusts the balance deduction and remaining payment. Review the updated amount before continuing; old payment links are discarded.\n- Windows TUN service installation reports the failed step, error code, and recovery advice.\n- Concurrent subscription refreshes preserve your latest name, address, and refresh interval changes.\n- Password and two-step verification operations avoid duplicate submissions, and signing out clears the local message cache.\n",
